howl-report 2
profile el++
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 2
inconsistent false
omitted 4
omission DataAxiom(<http://example.org/t#a> <http://example.org/t#q> "x" .)
omission DataAxiom(<http://example.org/t#p> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://example.org/t#A> .)
omission DataAxiom(<http://example.org/t#q> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://example.org/t#A> .)
omission DataAxiom(<http://example.org/t#q> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/t#p> .)
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 3
sub http://example.org/t#A http://example.org/t#A
sub http://example.org/t#A http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
